WEBVTT

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:30.367
na macho mengi yakiniangalia,

00:01:31.238 --> 00:01:33.639
najisikia mbichi na mtupu.

00:01:36.046 --> 00:01:37.690
Pale hisia hii inapokuwepo,

00:01:37.714 --> 00:01:41.554
ninajiamini kua hatua ijayo
ya uponyaji inawadia,

00:01:43.422 --> 00:01:45.919
na inaniruhusu
kushirikisha hadithi kikamilifu.

00:01:47.362 --> 00:01:52.289
Kwa ajili ya muonekano wote,
nilizaliwa kwenye familia ya hali bora:

00:01:52.805 --> 00:01:54.939
mama, baba, dada, kaka.

00:01:55.671 --> 00:02:00.623
Bertha, Eldra mdogo, Taydama na
Eldra wa tatu.